│                          │ 3. Parametrized CRZ gates instead of fixed CZ gates to enable learned entanglement        │
│                          │ patterns                                                                                  │
│                          │ 4. Shared RY/RZ parameters across the qubit chain to reduce redundancy                    │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ This should improve parameter efficiency (accuracy per parameter) and potentially reduce  │
│                          │ convergence time while maintaining or improving test accuracy. The ring + cross topology  │
│                          │ provides better information flow across all 8 qubits compared to the linear chain.        │
