│ patch_description        │ The current program achieves 0.85 combined score with 146 parameters and good accuracy    │
│                          │ (0.87 test). However, the second prior program achieved the same 0.85 score with only 68  │
│                          │ parameters, suggesting we can improve parameter efficiency while maintaining or improving │
