│ patch_description        │ The current program achieves a combined score of 0.87 with 122 parameters and good        │
│                          │ validation accuracy (0.90). However, analyzing the prior programs reveals:                │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ 1. The second program (score 0.86) with 92 parameters achieved better test accuracy (0.87 │
│                          │ vs 0.85) despite fewer parameters, suggesting parameter efficiency improvements are       │
│                          │ valuable.                                                                                 │
│                          │ 2. The current program has many parametrized CRY gates (8 total) which can make the       │
│                          │ optimization landscape complex.                                                           │
│                          │ 3. The current depth (87) is moderate but could benefit from additional non-parametrized  │
│                          │ entanglement to improve global connectivity without increasing parameter count.           │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ The recommendation suggests adding parameter-free CZ cross-block entanglement on          │
│                          │ non-adjacent qubit pairs. This approach:                                                  │
│                          │ - Adds global connectivity between distant qubits (e.g., 0-4, 1-5, 2-6, 3-7) with CZ      │
│                          │ gates that cost no parameters                                                             │
│                          │ - Improves representational power without complicating the optimizer's landscape          │
│                          │ - Increases circuit depth modestly (adds ~4 gates per block, ~24 total across all blocks) │
│                          │ - Should enhance feature learning by enabling long-range qubit correlations               │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ This is orthogonal to the parameter sharing already in place and complements the existing │
│                          │ CRY gates for local interactions.                                                         │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ Implementation: Insert a layer of parameter-free CZ gates on four non-adjacent pairs      │
│                          │ after the second CRY layer and before the final RZ layer in ANSATZ_SPEC.                  │
